# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dustwallow Marsh

step Questioning Reethe
  tip Ogron waits in the Quagmire east of the village. Follow him to Reethe and keep him alive through the fight that breaks out.
  accept 1273
  complete 1273 @42.6,38.1 map 1445

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Witch Hill

step Stinky Ignatz
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Head north to Witch Hill. Stinky stands at the foot of the hill; escort him while he gathers Bogbean Leaves just south of it.
  accept 1270
  complete 1270

step Mirefin murlocs
  tip The Mirefin murlocs crowd the coast east and north-east of Witch Hill; every kind drops heads.
  collect 5847 quest 1177

step Swamp Eye Jarl
  tip Jarl lives in the Swamplight Manor south-east of Witch Hill.
  accept 1238                         -- Loose Dirt, beside the manor
  accept 1218                         -- "Swamp Eye" Jarl
  buy 3713 x3 nearest                 -- Soothing Spices, if you did not buy them in Orgrimmar
  turnin 1218
  accept 1206

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back west

step Brackenwall Village: kill these as you meet them
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Head west back across the marsh. The Darkfang Venomspitters on the ridges north of Brackenwall drop the venom sacs. Theramore Infiltrators (35-36) sneak through the same woods: they are stealthed, so look closely.
  tip The Darkmist spiders swarm the cavern mouth north-west of Brackenwall; every kind drops eyes.
  tip Careful: Darkfang Lurkers (level 36-37) use Sneak to stealth while out of combat and cast Poison once fighting.
  tip Careful: Stealthed spiders in the same area will attack you on sight.
  tip Careful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them.
  collect 5959 quest 1322
  collect 5884 quest 1206
  kill 4834 quest 1201

step Brackenwall Village
  turnin 1238
  turnin 1201                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  accept 1202
  turnin 1322                         -- Do'gol
  accept 1323
  turnin 1323                         -- Krog
  turnin 1273                         -- Krog

step Swamp Eye Jarl
  tip Head east back to the Swamplight Manor.
  accept 1239                         -- Loose Dirt, now that Nazeer has read the report
  turnin 1206
  accept 1203 optional                -- only if you carry a Moonsteel Broadsword (Blacksmithing or the Auction House)
  turnin 1203 optional

step The Theramore Docks
  collect 5882 quest 1202.1 @71.5,51.2 map 1445 -- Underwater

step Brackenwall Village
  tip Head back west to Brackenwall with the head: Mudcrush Durtfeet stands at the south edge of the village where the road comes in, Nazeer Bloodpike in the village.
  turnin 1177                         -- Mudcrush Durtfeet
  turnin 1202                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
  turnin 1239                         -- Nazeer Bloodpike
