step Level 37.5
  when level<37.5
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Desolace's last quests and Alterac are 38-41. Still below 37.5 after Brackenwall's hand-ins? The Darkmist spiders and Lurkers (35-38) by the cavern north-west of the village are the closest: kill them until level 37.5. Or, with a group, run the Razorfen Downs dungeon or the Scarlet Monastery dungeon (Armory) instead.
  goto 31.4,22.2 map 1445 "Darkmist cavern"
  level 37.5 grind 4377               -- grind on Darkmist Lurker

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ratchet

step Fly to Ratchet
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  goto 35.6,31.8 "Brackenwall Village flight master"
  fly "Ratchet"
  zone The Barrens

step Ratchet
  zone The Barrens
  tip Gazlowe waits upstairs in the house by the flight master; Mebok Mizzyrix stands below it, towards the docks.
  turnin 1178                         -- Gazlowe
  note Gazlowe's next errand takes you to Booty Bay, off this part of the route: leave it.
  turnin 1270                         -- Mebok Mizzyrix
  turnin 1111                         -- Wharfmaster Dizzywig, on the docks
  note Dizzywig's parts go back to Kravel in the Shimmering Flats, off the route: leave them.

step The Affray
  zone The Barrens
  only Warrior
  tip Head south along the coast from Ratchet to Fray Island. Klannoc Macleod stands by the arena: step on the grate to start the fight; the challengers come one at a time, then Big Will (33).
  turnin 1718                         -- Klannoc Macleod
  accept 1719
  complete 1719 @68.6,48.7 map 1413
  turnin 1719                         -- Klannoc Macleod: Berserker Stance

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace, the second visit

step Fly to Shadowprey Village
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.1,37.1 "Ratchet flight master"
  fly "Shadowprey Village"
  zone Desolace

step Shadowprey Village
  zone Desolace
  tip Taiga Wisemane stands in the village.
  accept 5581                         -- Taiga Wisemane

step Portals of the Legion
  zone Desolace
  tip Head east to Mannoroc Coven. With the Hand of Iruxos from Taiga in your bags, open a demon portal's ring: a Demon Portal Guardian (38-39) comes out; kill it to close that portal. Six portals. Careful: Infernals, Doomguards and Burning Blade Summoners walk close by many portals and may join in; kill nearby mobs first or drag the guardian away, for example toward the coven's central lake.
  goto 52.0,78.0 "Mannoroc Coven"
  complete 5581

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  tip North to the post; Gurda Wildmane stands beside Felgur.
  accept 93225                        -- Gurda Wildmane

step Valley of Spears
  zone Desolace
  tip West of the post, the Maraudine centaurs hold the Valley of Spears. Every Maraudine can drop a Carved Centaur Totem and an ear for Felgur's Centaur Bounty.
  collect 254432 x5 quest 93225.1
  collect 6067 quest 1366

step Melizza Brimbuzzle
  zone Desolace
  tip Melizza is held in the Maraudine camp at the valley's western end; free her and escort her out east of the valley.
  tip Careful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.
  accept 6132
  complete 6132

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  zone Desolace
  tip Hornizz waits at the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard.
  turnin 6132
  accept 6134

step The Valley of Bones
  zone Desolace
  tip Head south-east to the bone fields of the Valley of Bones, where Undead Ravagers roam. At the far south-east, use the Crate of Ghost Magnets to draw the Magrami Spectres: they drop the ghost-o-plasm.
  use 15848 quest 6134.1 @63.5,91.6 map 1443
  collect 15849 quest 6134            -- Ghost-o-plasm

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  zone Desolace
  tip North to the goblin camp on the west side of the Kodo Graveyard.
  turnin 6134

step Ghost Walker Post
  zone Desolace
  turnin 1366                         -- Felgur Twocuts
  turnin 93225                        -- Gurda Wildmane

step Shadowprey
  zone Desolace
  tip West to Shadowprey.
  turnin 5581                         -- Taiga Wisemane

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly from Shadowprey Village to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; fly on to Orgrimmar from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Fly to Orgrimmar
  only !Druid
  zone Desolace
  goto 21.6,74.0 "Shadowprey Village flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Back to Orgrimmar
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
